Ontario QSO Party -- entries used by an Ontario entrant
The 50 Ontario multipliers (each its own multiplier), then the 50 US states, DC and the 12 provinces and territories other than Ontario.
The Ontario file comes FIRST, so MAN is Manitoulin District and not P12's Manitoba alias (the first alias added wins).
The provinces are listed here and not taken from P13.DOM: Ontario is no province multiplier for an Ontario entrant (an Ontario station sends its county),
P13.DOM accepts neither NF nor LB for Newfoundland and Labrador, and P12.DOM gives MAN to Manitoba.
DXCC countries are a DX multiplier from the call (the class), so there is no DX entry.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.
http://www.va3cco.com/oqp/

INCLUDE FILE ontario_cty.dom
INCLUDE FILE S50.DOM
INCLUDE FILE DC.DOM

Ns = VE1,NS,^Nova Scotia
Qc = VE2,QC,QUE,QU,PQ,^Quebec
Mb = VE4,MB,^Manitoba
Sk = VE5,SK,SAS,SASK,^Saskatchewan
Ab = VE6,AB,ALB,ALT,^Alberta
Bc = VE7,BC,^British Columbia
Nt = VE8,NT,NW,NWT,^Northwest Territories
Nb = VE9,NB,^New Brunswick
Nu = VY0,NU,^Nunavut
Yt = VY1,YT,YK,YU,^Yukon
Pe = VY2,PE,PEI,^Prince Edward Island
Nl = VO1,VO2,NL,NF,LB,LAB,^Newfoundland and Labrador
